# graphify: keep only the paid-for semantic cache and the report; everything else is
# machine-specific or regenerated for free by `/graphify .`
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/cache/*
!graphify-out/cache/semantic/
